@startuml
' Diagram author: Eethanzyj.
' Depicted storage persistence implementation: WillChin484848 (PR #42).
' Original capacity feature: Kaishhhh.
title Capacity saving
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
hide footbox

participant ":BakerCli" as Cli
participant "<<class>>\nParser" as Parser
participant ":CapacityCommand" as Cmd
participant "orders:OrderList" as Orders

[-> Cli : capacity 3
activate Cli
Cli -> Parser : parseCapacity(input)
activate Parser
Parser --> Cli : 3
deactivate Parser
create Cmd
Cli -> Cmd : new CapacityCommand(3)
activate Cmd
deactivate Cmd
Cli -> Cmd : execute(orders)
activate Cmd
Cmd -> Orders : setDailyCapacity(3)
activate Orders
deactivate Orders
ref over Cmd, Orders : Read workload counts and build the result.
Cmd --> Cli : message: String
deactivate Cmd
Cli -> Cli : print message
activate Cli
deactivate Cli
ref over Cli, Orders : Run saveChanges callback;\nsee "Saving after every change".
note over Cli, Orders
  Storage saves # dailyCapacity=3 with the records.
  Bare capacity and invalid input do not request saving.
end note
[<-- Cli
deactivate Cli
@enduml
